#NEXUS

[ arai2023a_fig3: Ceratosaur time tree, read by eye at 3x; fully pectinate at the base. One polytomy of six: Afrominus, Velocisaurus, Vespersaurus, Noasaurus, Masiakasaurus and the Limusaurus clade. The Abelisauridae wedge is one tip. No clade names are printed; range bars are not branches. 19 tips, 1 polytomies (6 children). Sample 9 case (census 3, seed 20261272). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

